%% Figure 4.2 - DOM Delta Processing pipeline
%% Input: current and previous DOM snapshots + task description
%% Output: top-20 candidates with hybrid keyword + MiniLM score
%% Intended caption: "DOM Delta Processing: structural-UID tracking plus hybrid keyword + MiniLM
%% scoring on the delta subset."
flowchart LR
    subgraph Inputs
        T[Task description]
        CURR[Current DOM<br/>parsed HTML]
        PREV[Previous DOM Snapshot<br/>held in memory]
    end

    CURR --> UID[Assign Structural UID<br/>MD5 over tag, id, name, xpath]
    PREV --> UID

    UID --> CLASS[Classify each element<br/>added / modified / unchanged]

    CLASS --> ANC[Ancestor Summary<br/>up to 4 ancestors:<br/>form, nav, section, dialog, ...<br/>suffix: ctx=form#signup ...]

    T --> KW[Keyword Scorer<br/>substring + fuzzy match<br/>weighted by attribute importance]
    ANC --> KW

    T --> ML[MiniLM Encoder<br/>all-MiniLM-L6-v2<br/>22M params]
    ANC --> ML
    ML --> COS[Cosine similarity<br/>task-embed vs elem-embed]

    KW --> FUSE[Late Fusion<br/>score = 0.6 * norm_kw + 0.4 * cosine]
    COS --> FUSE

    FUSE --> TOP[Top-20 candidates<br/>to Grounder]
